_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:09.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:09.000000Z"},{"id":5123441,"path":"https://res-2.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1775566219/5jmj_d37f5129-5e43-4f1a-8b89-bd8ffb98734e.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":38,"rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:09.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:09.000000Z"},{"id":5123477,"path":"https://res-2.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1775566451/5jmj_40d4361e-4382-4978-89e8-a231b116f426.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":39,"rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:11.000000Z"}],"image":{"id":5123444,"path":"https://res-2.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1775566241/5jmj_5554b3d2-b86f-43c8-8c24-a5779113163b.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:09.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:09.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":6009009,"review":"We had a lovely stay, everything was great","rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6023184,"review":"Great location close to the marinas and beaches. Pool in front of the unit is very convenient. Spacious in living, dining and outdoor areas. Comfortable beds and couches. Host is responsive. Cleanliness could have been better.","rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6111198,"review":"excellent stay with outstanding host and nice neighborhood in the middle of Gouna near all  attractions and destinations","rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6138671,"review":"The apartment was great and clean , the location is nice and near all spots, Mangroovy is really great place to stay offering very nice pools and free beach access to one of the nicest beaches in Gouna","rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6144715,"review":"The Place is exactly same as photos and description, spacious and very comfy easily accommodates 6 people consisting of 3 Master Rooms and 4 Bathrooms, the Garden and seating is nice and Pool just in-front of the garden and Sea is a walking distance.\nThere are two supermarkets and restaurants nearby for quick grab n go. \nInternet is very fast as well, much recommended and  Xuru Team was very responsive and always making sure that things are going smoothly.","rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6151795,"review":"Stay overall was great for my self and the family,  the apartment is really family friendly with it’s direct access to the pool and spacious garden, Thanks Xuru for the timely support though the stay.","rental_id":258715,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}